{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"半分終わったー＼(*´ω`*)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑とは何か。それは、いわゆる\n「過去の質問返しをまとめたもの」って\n感じかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去なので時制とかおかしなことになる質問も\n中にはあるかもだけど、\nま、そゆことなんでねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1136"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か決め事ってある!?\n1137"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲン担ぎとかするの?\nのーっ\nぱんぱんぱんっぎゅっ\nぱんぱんぱんっ\nぱんぱんぱんっぎゅ〜っ\nせーのっ\n努力!感謝!笑顔!\nうちらは乃木坂上り坂!\n46!\nいえーい＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1138"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶髪と黒髪どっちが好きー?\n1139"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男の人の髪は短い方が好き?それとも長い方が好き?\nそーゆーのはあんまよくわかんないかな。\n似合ってればどんな髪したって素敵なはず(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1140"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『スウィーツ男子』ひめたん的どう思う?\nひめたんと気が合うじゃないですかー♪♪\nかわいいかわいーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1141"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今一番旅行しに行きたい場所はどこ?\nこりあ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1142"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回ひめたんに質問しようと思っても、なかなかいいネタが浮かばない...なんかいい質問ありますか?\n1143"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回答してもらうにはどんな質問したらいいんやろう(--;)?\n1144"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな質問したら採用されますか教えてください\n1145"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントに書いてある質問は全部答えてるんですか?\n1146"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気のせいかな?私の質問がひとつも出てないのは?ww\nできるだけたくさんの質問に答えたいなっていつも思ってるので今まで答えたことのない質問を優先して答えるようにしてます!\nだから、あれっ何で日芽香無視するんよーって思う前にひめたん大図鑑だよ1〜10とそれ以降の過去の記事を読んで同じ質問がないかなって探してみてくださいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1147"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪で食べておきたいものがあれば教えてください。\nたこなしたこやき!\nそういや前にお邪魔した時にたこやき食べてなかった(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1148"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に来た人って、何人くらい覚えてますか?\n全員数えてたら日が昇る!\nてか数えてるうちに多分寝る。寝てまう('・・`)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1149"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会っていろんな県から来てる人いると思うけどびっくりしたのはどこから来てる人だった?\n遠くから来られてる人いた?海外とか?\n海外からお越しの方にはまだあったことないなあ\nひめたんは北海道や沖縄から来てたらびっくりするし\n会場の超近場から来ててもこれまたびっくりするし\n結局どこから来てもびっくりする!\n乃木坂はこんなとこにまで浸透してるのかーとでもいいましょうか(^ω^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1150"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の名前、握手会で言えば分かる?\nわかる自信あるよー(ω)☆\n言ってみるしかっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1151"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会のときにフルネームで呼んでいい?\n呼んで呼んでっ♪♪\nなかもとーひーめかー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1152"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ジャーじゃなくてアディジャーで握手行ってもいい?(笑)\nあ、あでぃじゃ。わら\n乃木じゃでなくあでぃじゃ。\n一応許可はするけれどもー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1153"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でコメントしてる名前言ったら覚えてくれる??\n1154"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回ひめたんのとこ行ったら覚えてくれるー??\n1155"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの顔とかって覚えてるもんなの?\n覚えてるよ結構☆\nただし記憶を引っ張り出すのに時間がかかることあるから誰か中元さんの頭をお掃除してくださいなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1156"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の握手会では名古屋の分まで俺を楽しませてくれる?\nよしっ約束しましょう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1157"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪個別もご欠席ってこたあないよね?\nないないないよ行くよー!\n楽しみすぎて最近全然寝れなーい(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/10/6559091/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}